  "claim": "American actor and musician Sam Witwer stars on the supernatural television series, Being Human, which is a remake of a show with the same name, featured on the BBC network.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Sam Witwer. Sentence: Samuel Stewart \"Sam\" Witwer (born October 20, 1977) is an American actor and musician.\nPage: Sam Witwer. Sentence: He has portrayed Crashdown in \"Battlestar Galactica\", Davis Bloome in \"Smallville\", and vampire Aidan Waite of the US/Canadian remake of BBC's supernatural drama series \"Being Human\" on Syfy in the US and Space in Canada.\nPage: Being Human (North American TV series). Sentence: Being Human is a supernatural drama television series broadcast on Syfy in the United States and on Space in Canada.\nPage: Being Human (North American TV series). Sentence: It was produced by Muse in Montreal as a remake of the BBC show of the same name.",
